cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Single-Section Histology-MRI Brain Registration: An Automated 2D-to-3D Approach Without Auxiliary Data"
abstract: >-
  histo2mri registers a single 2D histology section to a 3D MRI volume without
  serial sections, a block-face photograph or any other auxiliary data. Each
  section is mapped onto a curved sheet in MRI voxel space, so a point on the
  slide and a point in the volume convert into each other in both directions.
